notes.content:
[b]Newspaper glitch fixed:[/b] You can't press E while looking at the newspapers;

[b]Buffed Swampmonster:[/b] In the level where Swampmonster tries to get you, made him a bit faster, so you can't escape by just walking;

[b]Added temporary error fixes in the gas station first levels:[/b] If you encounter a major bug, you get a screen to restart the level where you were in;

[b]Added a new secret ending:[/b] In the level where you made a mistake (by choosing the wrong option with the customers) you can find a secret room.
